WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.776
QuotePlate connects your kitchen, purchasing decisions
and suppliers.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.180
Five sections organise your work:

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.515
Today, Purchases, Suppliers, Menu, and Reports.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.381
Start with a menu photo, typed dishes, or a permitted
website import.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.996
Review the ingredients, quantities and units, then
approve your menu.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.340
Find nearby food businesses inside QuotePlate.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.060
Choose your area, category and distance.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.880
These are real public map listings with contact
details when available.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.220
Coverage varies.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.040
Check products and delivery capability before adding a
supplier.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.976
Set ingredients, quantities, delivery timing and reply
deadline.

00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:49.309
Choose suppliers and review your draft.

00:00:49.529 --> 00:00:52.015
Suppliers enter prices through a private link,

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.888
review delivery and total, then send their quote.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.658
Review each supplier’s offer: quantities, taxes,
freight and delivery terms.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.155
Choose one supplier or split the purchase by item.

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:11.692
Save your reason and the accepted decision.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.933
Record what arrived, including received and rejected
quantities.

00:01:16.153 --> 00:01:18.790
Check billed quantities and rates against the order.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.761
Track credits claimed, credits received and settlement
references.

00:01:24.981 --> 00:01:28.394
Delivery evidence feeds the supplier’s performance
record.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.827
Each supplier has a separate private workspace for
their own orders.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.787
They can confirm quantities, or agree or dispute
delivery records with a reference.

00:01:42.007 --> 00:01:46.269
If the restaurant corrects a record, earlier
confirmation becomes outdated.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.973
In Today, open Plan meals and set your portions.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.082
Review usable stock, expected yield and confirmed
arrivals.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:03.360
Review the ingredient shortages and purchase
quantities, then create a draft.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.388
Choose the missing ingredients a supplier should
prepare for.

00:02:08.608 --> 00:02:10.667
Share only those estimated quantities.

00:02:10.887 --> 00:02:13.399
Recipes, portions and stock stay private.

00:02:13.619 --> 00:02:16.878
These estimates are not orders, and your team can
withdraw them.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.272
Check wholesale terms, served PIN codes and delivery
lead times.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.398
Reuse matching past prices, then confirm today’s
quantities and terms.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:37.633
Review delivery records, outstanding credits, and
billed cost per accepted unit.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:41.820
QuotePlate. Every quote, accountable.
